Missing from the wish list posted from the spoilers is one of the best
things to wish for:
		    "blessed magic marker"

Why wish for scrolls of enchant weapon when you can write lots more
than three of them, plus a heap of other scrolls, with a magic marker?
Use one of the scrolls of charging you will have wished for previously to
recharge the marker, or write one yourself. If I don't get a marker at
some point earlier in the game I always make sure I have at least half a
dozen blank scrolls by the time I get to the castle. 

Where did the idea that +3 is the optimum enchantment to wish for come
from? Is it from the code, or is it a Nethack myth. From my experience I
would guestimate that when you wish for +3 you get it around 50% of the
time, whereas +2 you get around 90%.  Why even bother wishing for +3 on
weapons, you only have to engrave with them to blunt them back to +2 so
you can read your blessed scrolls of enchant weapon safely.

